{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2023-05-11 10:00:00', 'title': 'ARDAGH GLASS PACKAGING MANUFACTURES UNIQUE EMBOSSED GLASS MASON JARS FOR NEWELL BRANDS', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS , MAY 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ARDAGH GLASS PACKAGING – NORTH AMERICA (AGP – NORTH AMERICA) , A BUSINESS OF ARDAGH GROUP , COLLABORATED WITH NEWELL BRANDS , THE MAKER OF BALL® HOME CANNING JARS,\xa0TO DESIGN AND MANUFACTURE THE BALL® HONEYBEE KEEPSAKE MASON JARS. THE BALL® HONEYBEE KEEPSAKE MASON JARS , AVAILABLE IN PINT SIZES, ARE PERFECT FOR CANNING, CRAFTING AND DECORATING.'}